%% M² send gate states (it only advises, never blocks sending for real)
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> open
  open --> locked : tension 55 or more, held 3 s
  locked --> review : tension under 30, held 8 s
  review --> open : person confirms re-read
  review --> locked : tense again
  locked --> open : override
  review --> open : override
  note right of open
    Poor signal (quality under 0.4):
    timers cleared, never locks
  end note
